# evidence-for: FR-016, FR-033, FR-041, AC-018
#
# AC-018. API and CLI are read by their letters and expanding them reads as
# condescension, so neither is undefined jargon; ZQX, which no reader has met,
# still is. The second half is the set measured against the regex that has to
# produce every entry: nothing in it is shorter than two characters or longer
# than six, so nothing in it is unreachable, and WARNING -- seven characters --
# is gone rather than the ceiling being widened to reach it.
